.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Represent an ``Accept`` header\&.

Base class for :class:`AcceptValidHeader`, :class:`AcceptNoHeader`, and
:class:`AcceptInvalidHeader`\&.

.fi
.PP
 
